    "The answers depend on current policy, so do not rely on unofficial information from forums or social media. If you have trouble logging in before making your final withdrawal, first follow the guide on [[__SLUG__-tidak-boleh-login|fixing __BRAND__ login problems]].",
    "Note down the answers you receive along with the date of the conversation. This record is useful if you need to refer back to the decision in future."
